    "body": "Here's another option which doesn't require a copy:\r\n\r\n```rust\r\nlet use_logical_path = module.config_value_bool(\"use_logical_path\").unwrap_or(true);\r\nlet pwd_dir = if use_logical_path { std::env::var(\"PWD\").ok() } else { None };\r\nlet current_dir = pwd_dir\r\n    .as_ref()\r\n    .map(|d| Path::new(d))\r\n    .unwrap_or_else(|| context.current_dir.as_ref());\r\n```\r\n\r\nEDIT: Forgot to check `use_logical_path`",
