    "body": "I think the majority of users wouldn't be able to tell the difference, let alone knowing that they want to change this configuration option.\r\n\r\nI really like what was being done here: https://github.com/starship/starship/pull/316/files/29f07ff0956e6a086baa3eb5ab067acb36bcb02e#diff-170a3f2c0a87c4f6c25b4d944865f1c8R121-R131\r\nWhat are your thoughts around adding an \"Advanced configuration\" table that is hidden within a spoiler for configuration options that wouldn't be immediately visible to the average user?",
